@startuml 使用案例1_2_動物搜尋篩選
title 使用案例1.2: 動物搜尋篩選

actor "所有使用者" as User
participant "Animals.vue" as AnimalsPage
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "shelter.py(model)" as ShelterModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "MinIO" as Storage

== 1. 初始狀態 ==
User -> AnimalsPage: 在動物列表頁面
activate AnimalsPage
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示篩選條件區域\n(預設值: 全部)

== 2. 設定篩選條件 ==
alt 選擇物種
    User -> AnimalsPage: 選擇物種\n(CAT/DOG)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 filters.species
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 自動觸發搜尋\n(@change 事件)
else 選擇性別
    User -> AnimalsPage: 選擇性別\n(MALE/FEMALE)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 filters.sex
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 自動觸發搜尋\n(@change 事件)
else 選擇年齡範圍
    User -> AnimalsPage: 選擇年齡範圍\n(0-6個月, 6-12個月等)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 觸發 handleAgeChange()
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 解析年齡範圍\nageRange = "0-6"
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 設定 min_age = 0, max_age = 6
    note right
      特殊處理:
      - max_age = 999 時不傳送
      - 表示無上限 (7歲以上)
    end note
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 呼叫 handleSearch()
else 選擇地區
    User -> AnimalsPage: 選擇縣市\n(台北市、新北市等)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 filters.region
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 自動觸發搜尋\n(@change 事件)
else 選擇來源
    User -> AnimalsPage: 選擇來源\n(收容所/個人送養)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 filters.source_type\n('shelter' 或 'personal')
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 自動觸發搜尋\n(@change 事件)
else 輸入關鍵字
    User -> AnimalsPage: 輸入搜尋關鍵字\n(在名稱、品種欄位)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 filters.q
    User -> AnimalsPage: 按 Enter 或點選搜尋按鈕
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 觸發 handleSearch()
end

== 3. 執行搜尋 ==
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: handleSearch()\n重設 filters.page = 1
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 組合所有篩選參數
note right
  篩選參數結構:
  {
    species: 'CAT',
    sex: 'MALE',
    min_age: 0,
    max_age: 6,
    region: '台北市',
    source_type: 'shelter',
    q: '橘貓',
    status: 'PUBLISHED',
    page: 1,
    per_page: 12
  }
end note

AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: getAnimals(filters)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals\n?species=CAT&sex=MALE\n&min_age=0&max_age=6\n&region=台北市\n&source_type=shelter\n&q=橘貓\n&status=PUBLISHED\n&page=1&per_page=12
activate AnimalBlueprint

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 檢查 JWT Token (可選)\nverify_jwt_in_request(optional=True)
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 解析查詢參數\n收集 filters dict
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: list_animals(filters, current_user_id)
activate AnimalService

== 4. 建立查詢 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 取得分頁參數\npage=1, per_page=12 (最多100)
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 建立基礎查詢\nquery = Animal.query.filter_by(deleted_at=None)

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 檢查並套用狀態篩選
note right
  預設邏輯:
  - 若 filters.status 為空
  - 自動設為 PUBLISHED
  - 只顯示已發布動物
end note
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 轉換狀態為 Enum\nstatus_enum = AnimalStatus(status)
AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter_by(status=status_enum)

alt 有物種篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 轉換物種為 Enum\nspecies_enum = Species(species)
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter_by(species=species_enum)
    note right: AND species='CAT'
end

alt 有性別篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 轉換性別為 Enum\nsex_enum = Sex(sex)
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter_by(sex=sex_enum)
    note right: AND sex='MALE'
end

alt 有來源類型篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 檢查 source_type
    alt source_type == 'shelter'
        AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter(Animal.shelter_id.isnot(None))
        note right: AND shelter_id IS NOT NULL
    else source_type == 'personal'
        AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter(Animal.owner_id.isnot(None))
        note right: AND owner_id IS NOT NULL
    end
end

alt 有地區篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 建立地區子查詢
    note right
      使用 EXISTS 子查詢:
      1. shelter_region_condition
         - JOIN Shelter
         - WHERE region LIKE '%台北市%'
      2. owner_region_condition
         - JOIN User
         - WHERE region LIKE '%台北市%'
    end note
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: shelter_condition = exists()\n.where(Animal.shelter_id == Shelter.shelter_id)\n.where(Shelter.region.like('%台北市%'))
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: owner_condition = exists()\n.where(Animal.owner_id == User.user_id)\n.where(User.region.like('%台北市%'))
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter(or_(shelter_condition, owner_condition))
end

alt 有年齡範圍篩選
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 檢查資料庫引擎類型\nengine_name = db.engine.name
    
    alt engine_name == 'sqlite'
        AnimalService -> AnimalService: 使用 julianday 計算月齡\nage_in_months = (julianday('now') - julianday(dob)) / 30.44
        note right
          SQLite 日期計算:
          - julianday('now') 取得當前日期
          - julianday(dob) 取得出生日期
          - 天數差 ÷ 30.44 = 月數
        end note
    else engine_name == 'mysql'
        AnimalService -> AnimalService: 使用 timestampdiff 計算月齡\nage_in_months = timestampdiff(MONTH, dob, curdate())
        note right
          MySQL 日期計算:
          - timestampdiff 直接計算月份差
          - 更精確的月齡計算
        end note
    end
    
    alt min_age 有值
        AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter(age_in_months >= min_age)
        note right: AND 月齡 >= 0
    end
    
    alt max_age 有值
        AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter(age_in_months <= max_age)
        note right: AND 月齡 <= 6
    end
end

alt 有關鍵字搜尋
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: 建立 LIKE 查詢\nq = '橘貓'
    note right
      搜尋範圍:
      - Animal.name (名稱)
      - Animal.breed (品種)
      - Animal.description (描述)
      使用 OR 邏輯
    end note
    AnimalService -> AnimalService: query.filter(or_(Animal.name.like('%橘貓%'), Animal.breed.like('%橘貓%'), Animal.description.like('%橘貓%')))
end

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用排序\nquery.order_by(Animal.created_at.desc())
note right
  排序規則:
  - 最新上架優先
  - DESC 降冪排列
end note

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 套用分頁\nquery.paginate(page=1, per_page=12)

== 5. 執行查詢 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalModel: query.paginate(page, per_page)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: 執行複合 SQL 查詢
activate DB
note right
  完整 SQL 範例:
  SELECT * FROM animals
  WHERE deleted_at IS NULL
    AND status = 'PUBLISHED'
    AND species = 'CAT'
    AND sex = 'MALE'
    AND EXISTS (...)
    AND (name LIKE '%橘貓%' OR breed LIKE '%橘貓%')
  ORDER BY created_at DESC
  LIMIT 12 OFFSET 0
end note

DB -> DB: 執行 WHERE 條件篩選\n(多條件 AND 邏輯)
DB -> DB: 執行子查詢 (地區 EXISTS)
DB -> DB: 執行 LIKE 模糊搜尋\n(關鍵字 OR 邏輯)
DB -> DB: 計算總筆數 (COUNT(*))
DB -> DB: 套用分頁 (LIMIT + OFFSET)
DB --> AnimalModel: animals[] + total_count
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: pagination 物件\n{items[], total, page, pages}
deactivate AnimalModel

== 6. 載入關聯資料 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 批次載入關聯資料\n避免 N+1 查詢問題

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: 載入圖片關聯\n(images relationship)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM attachments\nWHERE animal_id IN (...)\nAND type='IMAGE'\nORDER BY display_order
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: images[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 圖片列表
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService -> ShelterModel: 載入收容所資訊\n(shelter relationship)
activate ShelterModel
ShelterModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM shelters\nWHERE shelter_id IN (...)
activate DB
DB --> ShelterModel: shelters[]
deactivate DB
ShelterModel --> AnimalService: 收容所資訊
deactivate ShelterModel

AnimalService -> UserModel: 載入送養者資訊\n(owner relationship)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id IN (...)
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: users[]
deactivate DB
UserModel --> AnimalService: 送養者資訊
deactivate UserModel

== 7. 組裝回應資料 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 批次載入關聯資料\n(避免 N+1 查詢問題)

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: 載入圖片關聯\n(images relationship)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM attachments\nWHERE animal_id IN (...)\nAND type='IMAGE'\nORDER BY display_order
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: images[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 圖片列表
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: 載入送養者資訊\n(shelter/owner relationship)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM shelters\nWHERE shelter_id IN (...)
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: shelters[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id IN (...)
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: users[]
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: 送養者資訊
deactivate AnimalModel

== 6. 檢查待審核申請 ==
loop 每個動物
    AnimalService -> AnimalModel: animal.has_pending_application()
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE animal_id = :id\nAND status IN ('PENDING', 'UNDER_REVIEW')\nLIMIT 1
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalModel: 是否有待審核申請
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> AnimalService: has_pending_application (boolean)
    deactivate AnimalModel
end

== 7. 組裝回應資料 ==
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 呼叫 animal.to_dict(include_relations=True)
note right
  序列化資料:
  - 動物基本資料
  - 圖片列表 (images[])
  - 送養者資訊 (shelter/owner)
  - 關聯資料完整載入
end note

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 組裝回應結構\n{animals: [...], total, page, per_page, pages}

AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: {animals[], pagination}
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 200 OK\n{animals[], total, page, per_page, pages}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> AnimalsPage: 搜尋結果
deactivate AnimalAPI

== 8. 顯示搜尋結果 ==
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新動物列表\nanimals.value = response.animals
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新分頁資訊\npagination = response
AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示結果數量\n「找到 X 隻動物」

alt 有搜尋結果 (animals.length > 0)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 渲染動物卡片列表
    loop 每個動物
        AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 使用 AnimalCard 組件顯示
        note right
          AnimalCard 顯示:
          - 動物圖片 (第一張)
          - 名稱、物種、性別
          - 年齡、品種
          - 送養者資訊
        end note
    end
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示分頁控制項
    AnimalsPage --> User: 顯示符合條件的動物列表
else 無搜尋結果 (animals.length === 0)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 顯示空狀態訊息
    AnimalsPage --> User: 顯示「無符合條件的動物」
    note right
      提示使用者:
      - 調整篩選條件
      - 清除部分篩選
      - 或點選「清除篩選」按鈕
    end note
end
deactivate AnimalsPage

== 9. 重設條件 ==
opt 使用者點選清除篩選
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選「清除篩選」按鈕
    activate AnimalsPage
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 觸發 handleReset()
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 清空所有篩選條件\nfilters = 預設值
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 重設頁碼 filters.page = 1
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: 重新載入動物列表\nloadAnimals()
    note right: 回到步驟 3, 重新執行搜尋
    AnimalsPage --> User: 顯示所有已發布動物\n(無任何篩選)
    deactivate AnimalsPage
end

== 10. 使用者後續操作 ==
alt 點選動物卡片
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選動物卡片
    activate AnimalsPage
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: router.push('/animals/:id')
    AnimalsPage --> User: 導航至動物詳情頁
    note right
      進入使用案例 1.3
      動物詳情檢視
    end note
    deactivate AnimalsPage
else 切換分頁
    User -> AnimalsPage: 點選分頁按鈕
    activate AnimalsPage
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: goToPage(page)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: 更新 filters.page
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalsPage: window.scrollTo(top:0)
    AnimalsPage -> AnimalAPI: 重新載入該頁動物
    note right: 回到步驟 3, 保持篩選條件
    deactivate AnimalsPage
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 顯示符合條件的動物 (多條件 AND 邏輯)
  2. 無結果時顯示友善提示訊息
  3. 篩選條件保持在 UI 上
  4. 支援多條件組合搜尋
  5. 支援分頁瀏覽 (12筆/頁)
  
  **搜尋範圍:**
  - 物種 (CAT/DOG)
  - 性別 (MALE/FEMALE)
  - 年齡範圍 (月齡)
  - 地區 (縣市)
  - 來源類型 (收容所/個人)
  - 關鍵字 (名稱、品種、描述)
  
  **效能優化:**
  - 批次載入關聯資料避免 N+1
  - 使用 EXISTS 子查詢優化地區搜尋
  - 資料庫層級計算年齡
  - 前端自動觸發搜尋 (@change)
  
  **資料一致性:**
  - 使用 Enum 驗證參數正確性
  - 預設只顯示 PUBLISHED 動物
  - 軟刪除資料不會出現
  - Model 層負責 ORM 查詢
  - Service 層處理業務邏輯
end note

@enduml
